This crate (`symphonia-codec-g729`) is a pure-Rust ITU-T G.729 / G.729 Annex D decoder. It is
licensed under the Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0, like the rest of Project Symphonia.

The algorithm is specified by ITU-T Recommendation G.729 (and Annex D). This implementation is a
port of FFmpeg's G.729 decoder: `libavcodec/g729dec.c`, `g729postfilter.c`, `g729data.h`,
`g729.h` and the shared CELP code it uses (`lsp.c`, `celp_filters.c`, `celp_math.c`,
`acelp_filters.c`, `acelp_vectors.c`, `acelp_pitch_delay.c`). The codebook, MA predictor, cosine,
interpolation filter and phase filter tables in `src/tables.rs` were extracted programmatically
from those files. FFmpeg is distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or
later.

